# INVWINPH.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PANEL.CFG, a settings file that is not there, on the loans of
# TEST/KEYS/PANEL.REQ: item 1 lent, returned and lent again, item 2 with
# a unit lent and a unit reserved, item 3 lent.  Items > Loans and holds
# shows the four open rows, earliest due first, and beside them the
# history of the first one's item, item 1: its two loans.  SHIFT-DOWN
# chooses item 2's loan with it, and the history is the focus row's
# item's, item 2's; DOWN to item 2's reservation, and it stays.  F6
# gives the history the focus, the count its rows'.  Return or release
# there on item 2's loan takes a row above the reservation out of the
# open rows: they still have the reservation selected, and the history
# keeps the focus.  INS there lends item 2 again, due before the
# reservation, a row above it: the reservation stays selected.  ESC
# gives the open rows the focus; Return or release on the new loan
# there leaves the reservation selected, another row of the same item,
# and the history, fetched again, shows the loan ended; the
# reservation's holder edited there shows in both.  From the history
# again, Return or release on the reservation itself takes the row the
# history follows out of the open rows: they keep its row number, item
# 3's loan now, and take the focus, the history following to item 3.
# View > Pane beside the list shows them alone, the row still selected,
# and again with the history; the splitter dragged left narrows them.
# CTRL-PGDN goes on to the open loans with their history; in add mode
# there, the second row alone chosen and the first the focus row, the
# history is the chosen row's item's.  On to the uses, none, the history
# is empty and disabled, F6 doing nothing.  READER sees the history,
# where INS is refused.  Every date is typed, so that no snapshot holds
# the day of the run.  The end by Exit: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/PANEL.CFG is the
# settings file it leaves.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPH.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I O
S LOANS
K SHIFT-DOWN
S SEVERAL
K DOWN
S SAME
K F6
S HISTORY
K ALT-C R
T 2026-10-07
K ENTER
S KEPT
K INS TAB
T Eve Hall
K TAB TAB
T 2026-10-07
K TAB
T 2026-11-05
K ENTER
S ABOVE
K ESC UP ALT-C R
T 2026-10-08
K ENTER
S ENDED
K CTRL-E
T Di Wolf
K ENTER
S EDITED
K F6 DOWN ALT-C R
T 2026-10-08
K ENTER
S RELEASED
K ALT-V P
S ALONE
K ALT-V P
S BOTH
M 220 DOWN MID
M 220 MOVE MID -60 0
M 220 UP MID -60 0
S DRAGGED
K CPGDN
S OPENLOAN
K SHIFT-F8 DOWN SPACE UP SPACE
S ADDMODE
K SHIFT-F8 CPGDN CPGDN
S NOUSES
K F6
S NOKEY
K ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-I O F6
S READER
K INS
S REFUSED
K ENTER ALT-F X
